<meta property="og:description" content="Elastic is aware of a remote code execution vulnerability (CVE-2026-114938, also known as Java4Shell) affecting OpenJDK and Oracle Java SE that was disclosed on November 17, 2026.  Elastic continues to monitor emerging information and will release further details as applicable and when available.  Kibana, Beats, Elastic Agent, APM Server, Elastic Cloud on Kubernetes (ECK) Operator, and Elastic Maps Server do not use Java and are not affected.  Affected components Elasticsearch Elastic has confir..." />
